0336000, "platform": 48, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1751359, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcv.jpg"}, {"id": 1751350, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcm.jpg"}, {"id": 1751351, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcn.jpg"}, {"id": 1751353, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcp.jpg"}, {"id": 1751355, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcr.jpg"}, {"id": 1751356, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcs.jpg"}, {"id": 1751358, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11jcu.jpg"}], "slug": "snow-bros-classic-collection", "summary": "It\u2019s always more fun to throw a snowball than to be hit by one!\n\nToaplan\u2018s hit Snow Bros. is back! This arcade-style, fixed-screen platformer follows brothers Nick and Tom through epic levels in the Kingdom of Hottoda to save two trapped princesses, each possessing the magic of snow\u2026 and the only hope for the realm. As evil King Atchich seeks to take over the world, the snowmen we love must set out to storm the enemy\u2019s fortress and rescue their princesses!\n\nShoot snow at your enemies, picking up items to enhance your fighting, from speed enhancements to shot powerups, becoming giant, and more. Each level features not only enemies but a boss fight, with unique characters to size up and snowball!\n\nWhether you have loved them since the 90s or are just discovering the snowy goodness now, Snow Bros. will show you exactly why it\u2019s such a timeless game.\n\nIncluded Games:\n\nSnow Bros.\nSnow Bros.: Nick & Tom\nSnow Bros. Jr.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/snow-bros-classic-collection", "collections": [{"id": 4621, "name": "Snow Bros."}]}